~ big_cheese_retiring
if not facts.big_cheese_retiring.known
	set facts.big_cheese_retiring.known = true
	Big Cheese: I'm The Big Cheese, don't worry, you've only missed the toast. But you're just in time for the fun! Have you tried the cheese? What do you think? Did it taste funny?...[wait=0.5] No? Perhaps my palate needs cleansing.
	Big Cheese: It's a shame that your first Cheese Ball is the last one, after tonight, I'll be retiring as The Big Cheese, it was a bit of a shock to the others but all good things must come to an end.
	Big Cheese: Regardless, we're happy to have you! I hope you enjoy yourself, theres nowhere else I'd rather be than here with my loyal friends, my found family, and that includes you now!
else:
	Big Cheese: Go be merry! You should be enjoying yourself.
=> END

~ start
if not npcs.BigCheese.has_met
	set npcs.BigCheese.has_met = true
	Big Cheese: Oh! Well hello there! You're fashionably late to the Cheese Ball! 
	=>< big_cheese_retiring
else:
	Big Cheese: Back for more cheddar I see?
	=>< big_cheese_retiring
=> END
